// CotSC localization Batch 23: QCHINTRO
@1 = ~(You awaken with a throbbing head and blurred vision. As your senses return, you recognise Candlekeep, yet everything is hideously wrong. The great library is twisted and decayed, the waters replaced by pools of blood. Empty ruins are tangled in crimson vines beneath a burning sky, and the air smells of ashes. This is your home, remade as a nightmare.)~
